Quiet settled flight still paid resetInstancedSpriteBuckets +
commitInstancedSpriteBuckets (4 buckets × 7 bindings) every tick after
the cloud was already empty. Latch after first idle publish; wake on
_activateSprite. Soft-GPU fps not claimed.
